 "audition": [
  "0.3-9.2 s: the violin, plain; on the first heart (4.3 s) it holds and decays under the hearts -- sincere, not \"world's smallest violin\"",
  "6.3-14.0 s: the pad pre-laps under the decay, a chord on each of the three words, then the bloom: does the decay-into-pad-into-LEVERAGE play as one run?",
  "14.4-23.9 s: LEVERAGE fades in under Mada and the bang lands inside it; STOP 4 at 23.9 s",
  "29.2-39.5 s: the C pedal holds under both posts; it rests on the sand at 39.5 s",
  "40.7-46.6 s: the stab, one chip note, F F F as one tenuto phrase; then the quiet",
  "51.0 s to the end: the felt settle onto the vault's F (a TEMP drone): a pedal, not a new cue"
 ],
